{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38979","headline":"李昭象云与二三同人见访有寄 · 杜荀鹤","name":"李昭象云与二三同人见访有寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"得君书後病颜开，云拉同人访我来。\n在路不妨冲雨雪，到山还免踏尘埃。\n吟沈水阁何宵月，坐破松岩几处苔。\n贫舍款宾无别物，止於空战大尊罍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38979.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38979","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}